)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (time map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4StoppingTime}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4StoppingTime}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\\in V\\setminus\\omega\">\\(\\infty\\in V\\setminus\\omega\\)</span> 是本接口固定的无穷时刻符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 在自然数上使用通常序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb4StoppingTime}_S(\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},T)\\leftrightarrow \\Omega\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n),\\Omega)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\leq n\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(m)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\Omega,\\omega\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\{w\\in\\Omega:\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(T(w)=k\\land k\\leq n)\\}\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}stopping\\text{-}time} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb4StoppingTime}_S(\\Omega,\\vec{\\mathcal F},T)\\leftrightarrow \\Omega\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathcal F},\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\Omega)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n),\\Omega)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\leq n\\to\\vec{\\mathcal F}(m)\\subseteq\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\Omega,\\omega\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\{w\\in\\Omega:\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(T(w)=k\\land k\\leq n)\\}\\in\\vec{\\mathcal F}(n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream filtration predicate expects a coded linear order as its second argument and existentially hides the sample space.  Expanding the filtration here both uses the actual order on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> and ties every sigma algebra to the displayed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exce